        },
        {
          "text": "Olunaku olwo bwe lulituuka, Musengwa Katonda aliiramu okukozesa obuyinza bwe, yaiza abantu be abaliba bawoniegho, yaabatoola mu Assiria, ni mu Misiri, ni mu Pathirosi, ni mu Ethiopia, ni mu Elamu, ni mu Shinari, ni mu Hamathi, ni mu biketezo eby'oku nhandha.",
